<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN GERMAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN GERMAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the German league championship after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>18 - Fredi Bobic (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
<p>17 - Ulf Kirsten (Bayer Leverkusen), Bernhard Winkler (1860 Munich)</p>
<p>16 - Giovane Elber (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
<p>15 - Paulo Sergio (Bayer Leverkusen), Sean Dundee (Karlsruhe)</p>
<p>14 - Andreas Herzog (Werder Bremen)</p>
<p>13 - Jonathan Akpoborie (Hansa Rostock)</p>
<p>12 - Toni Polster (Cologne), Juergen Klinsmann (Bayern Munich), Krasimir Balakov (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
